Presenton reference helpers
https://github.com/presenton/presenton
Upstream commit: 7376573fb30e4faf6225ff77d2cc74d06634b2e0

This directory contains selected implementation from Presenton's
servers/fastapi/templates/v2/content.py, distributed under Apache License 2.0.
See LICENSE.presenton for the full licence.

Retained functions: infographic_markdown_to_plain_text and
repeated_child_source_index, including the Markdown pattern definitions.
Modifications: removed unused imports and unrelated hydration functions;
adapted module location for Clastio's PowerPoint worker.

The upstream NOTICE enumerates licences for its separately bundled Python
and JavaScript dependencies. Those dependency implementations are not
included in this extracted module; unrelated notices are excluded.
